--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Interoperability
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The AccessPort file-transfer protocol implemented here was determined by
observing USB traffic between an AccessPort and its own host software, for the
sole purpose of interoperating with hardware the user already owns. This
project contains no COBB source code, firmware, calibration data, or map
content, and it does not modify, redistribute, or circumvent any COBB
software.

This project reads and writes files. It does not flash ECUs, does not perform
real-time tuning, and does not interpret or generate calibration data.
